  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPBC Project Support Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The IPBC Support Project - Phase 2 (IPBC Support - 2) aims to support and contribute to achieving the goals of the International Partnership for Blue Carbon (IPBC): Increased international commitments to protect coastal blue carbon ecosystems; Improved national policies to conserve, protect and restore coastal blue carbon ecosystems; Accelerated on-the-ground implementation of blue carbon conservation, protection and restoration activities.
Key activities of this project will focus on coordination, partner engagement, knowledge sharing, and communication. This project is a continuation of the IPBC Support Project (2020-2022) and builds on its successes and lessons learned.</narrative>
  </description>
